# Copy to .env.server for local development.
# The MCP server secret: seals OAuth codes and tokens and signs the state
# clients echo back when they confirm a deletion. At least 32 bytes, the same on
# every server instance. Changing it signs every MCP client out. This value is
# for local development only: in production, generate a fresh one with
# `openssl rand -base64 32`.
MCP_SECRET=dev-only-linkly-mcp-secret-change-me-0123456789
